hadiths[106]{hadithnumber,text}:
"326","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn from al- Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"327","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zubayr al-Makki from Abu't-Tufayl Amir ibn Wathila that Muadh ibn Jabal told him that they went out with the Messenger of Allah"
"328","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"329","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z Zubayr al-Makki from Said ibn Jubayr that Abdullah ibn Abbas said"
"330","(with regards to above) Malik said"
"331","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that he had asked Salim ibn Abdullah"
"332","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that AIi ibn Husain used to say"
"333","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from a man of the family of Khalid ibn Asid that he said to Abdullah ibn Umar"
"334","Yahya related to me from Malik from Salih ibn Kaysan from Urwa ibn az-Zubayr that A'isha"
"335","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that he said to Salim ibn Abdullah"
"336","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar"
"337","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Salim ibn Abdullah that his father rode to Rim and shortened the prayer on the journey. Malik said"
"338","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Salim ibn Abdullah that Abdullah ibn Umar rode to Dhat an-Nusub and shortened the prayer on the journey. Malik said"
"339","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Ibn Umar that he used to travel to Khaybar and he would shorten the prayer"
"340","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Salim ibn Abdullah that Abdullah ibn Umar used to shorten the prayer when he travelled for a whole day"
"341","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that he used to travel one mail-stage with Ibn Umar"
"342","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Abbas used to shorten the prayer when he travelled a distance equivalent to that between Makka and Ta'if"
"343","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Salim ibn Abdullah that Abdullah ibn Umar used to say"
"344","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Ibn Umar stayed in Makka for ten nights"
"345","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ata al-Khurasani that he heard Said ibn al Musayyab say"
"346","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Salim ibn Abdullah from his father that Umar ibn al-Khattab"
"347","Yahya related the same as that to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from his father from Umar ibn al-Khattab"
"348","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar used to pray four rakas behind the imam at Mina"
"349","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Safwan said"
"350","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar never used to pray anything with the fard prayer"
"351","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad and Urwa ibn az-Zubayr and Abu Bakr ibn Abd ar Rahman used to pray nawafil when travelling. Yahya said that Malik was asked about voluntary prayers when travelling and he said"
"352","Yahya related to me that Malik said"
"353","Yahya related to me from Malik from Amr ibn Yahya al-Mazini from Abu'l-Hubab Said ibn Yasar that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"354","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"355","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said"
"356","Yahya related to me from Malik from Musa ibn Maysara from Abu Murra"
"357","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'n Nadr"
"358","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az- Zubayr that A'isha"
"359","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from A'isha that she used to pray duha with eight rakas"
"360","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha from Anas ibn Malik that his grandmother"
"361","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba said"
"362","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Abd ar- Rahman ibn Abi Said al-Khudri from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"363","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'n Nadr"
"364","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that Kab al-Ahbar said"
"365","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Umar used to disapprove of passing in front of women while they were praying"
"366","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar would neither pass in front of anyone"
"367","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ibn Masud that Abdullah ibn Abbas said"
"368","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn Abi Waqqas used to pass in front of some of the rows while the prayer was in progress. Malik said"
"369","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Ali ibn Abi Talib said"
"370","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Salim ibn Abdullah that Abdullah ibn Umar used to say"
"371","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Umar would use the animal he was riding as a sutra when he prayed"
"372","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father used to pray in the desert without a sutra"
"373","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abu Jafar al-Qari said"
"374","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that he had heard that Abu Dharr used to say"
"375","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Umar ibn al-Khattab used to order the rows to be straightened"
"376","Yahya related to me from Malik from his paternal uncle"
"377","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abd al-Karim ibn Abi'l-Mukhariq al-Basri said"
"378","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu Hazim ibn Dinar that Sahl ibn Sad said"
"379","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar did not say qunut in any of the prayers"
"380","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that Abdullah ibn al-Arqam used to lead his companions in prayer. The time for prayer came one day and he went to relieve himself. When he returned"
"381","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"382","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"383","Malik said"
"384","Yahya related to me from Malik from Sumayy"
"385","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nuaym ibn Abdullah al-Mujmir that he heard Abu Hurayra say"
"386","Yahya related to me from Malik from al Ala ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Yaqub from his father from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"387","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab said"
"388","Yahya related to me from Malik from Amir ibn Abdullah ibn az- Zubayr from Amr ibn Sulaymaz-Zuraqi from Abu Qatadaal-Ansari that the Messenger of Allah"
"389","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'nNadr"
"390","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar used to place his palms flat on the surface where he put his forehead. Nafi said"
"391","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar used to say"
"392","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu Hazim Salama ibn Dinar from Sahl ibn Said as-Saidi that the Messenger of Allah"
"393","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Ibn Umar would never turn around when praying"
"394","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abu Jafar al-Qari said"
"395","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Abu Umama ibn Sahl ibn Hunayf said"
"396","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Masud used to move forward while in ruku"
"397","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Hazim from his father that Amr ibn Sulaym az-Zuraqi said"
"398","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nuaym ibn Abdullah al- Mujmirthat Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Zayd told him that Abu Masud al Ansari said"
"399","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Dinar said"
"400","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"401","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"402","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that when the Messenger of Allah"
"403","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from an-Numan ibn Murra that the Messenger of Allah"
"404","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"405","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar used to say"
"406","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman that if Abdullah ibn Umar arrived at the mosque and the people had already prayed"
"407","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar passed by a man who was praying and said"
"408","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar used to say"
"409","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban that his paternal uncle Wasi ibn Habban said"
"410","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that one of the muhajirun in whom he saw no harm asked Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As"
"411","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Said ibn al- Musayyab said"
"412","Yahya related to me from Malik from Amir ibn Abdullah ibn az- Zubayr from Amr ibn Sulaym az-Zuraqi from Abu Qutada al-Ansari that the Messenger of Allah"
"413","Yahya related to me from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"414","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father from A'isha"
"415","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Ata ibn Yazid al-Laythi that Ubaydullah ibn Adi ibnal-Khiyar said"
"416","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"417","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Mahmud ibn Rabi al-Ansari that Utban ibn Malik"
"418","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Abbad ibn Tamim from his paternal uncle that he saw the Messenger of Allah"
"419","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ihn al-Musayyab that Umar ibn al Khattab and Uthman ibn Affan"
"420","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Abdullah ibn Masud said to a certain man"
"421","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said"
"422","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that A'isha"
"423","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard from Amir ibn Sad ibn Abi Waqqas that his father said"
"424","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that if some one passed by Ata ibn Yasar in the mosque with something to trade"
"425","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn al-Khattab set aside an area near the mosque called al-Butayha and said"
"426","Yahya related to me from Malik from his paternal uncle Abu Suhayl ibn Malik that his father heard Talha ibn Ubaydullah say"
"427","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"428","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard more than one of their men of knowledge say"
"429","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar used to do ghusl on the day of Fitr before going to the place of prayer"
"430","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that the Messenger of Allah"
"431","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abu Bakr and Umar used to do that"